  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-snow-avalanche-susceptibility:\n\n- Evaluates snow avalanche susceptibility by combining slope, aspect, terrain roughness, snow depth, and temperature.\n- Supports both real multi-band GeoTIFF input and offline synthetic data generation.\n- Normalizes and weights each factor to produce a susceptibility index and classified risk levels.\n- Outputs include GeoTIFFs of risk index and level, factor weights in JSON, and a run manifest.\n- All processing is performed locally; no user data is uploaded.\n- Detailed Chinese and English documentation provided.",
